                            <run>
- If Orders (3H MA) Dropped &gt; 25% compared to Same Day Last Week </run>
                            <run bold='true'>AND</run>
                            <run> Yesterday
- If Fail Rate (3H MA) &gt; 20%
- If Delivery Time (3H MA) &gt; 45mins

</run>
                            <run bold='true'>Note: Once an alert has been triggered, the same alert will not be triggered again within the next 24 hours even if the threshold is exceeded</run>
